; τ. χειρῶν, Act.7:41; of the works of God, Heb.1:10; γῆ κ. τὰ ἐν αὐτῇ ἔ., 2Pe.3:10; τὸ ἔ. τ. θεοῦ, Rom.14:20.\n (AS)","source_line":2182}],"occurrence_count":169,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"obras","count":113},{"gloss":"obra","count":49},{"gloss":"trabalho","count":3},{"gloss":"ações","count":1},{"gloss":"fazendo-o","count":1},{"gloss":"ação","count":1},{"gloss":"feitos","count":1}]},"G2085":{"id":"G2085","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2085","disambiguated_id":"G2085 =","unique_id":"G2085","headword":"ἑτεροδιδασκαλέω","transliteration":"heterodidaskaleō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to teach heresy","definition_en":"ἑτεροδιδασκαλέω, -ῶ \n to teach other or different doctrine: 1Ti.1:3 6:3 (cf. CGT, in l; Milligan, NTD, 102).†\n (AS)","source_line":2227}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"ensinem-outra-doutrina","count":1},{"gloss":"ensina-doutrina-diferente","count":1}]},"G2307":{"id":"G2307","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2307","disambiguated_id":"G2307 =","unique_id":"G2307","headword":"θέλημα","transliteration":"thelēma","lexical_morphology":"G:N-N","gloss_en":"will/desire","definition_en":"θέλημα, -τος, τό\n (θέλω), [in LXX chiefly for חָפֵץ, also for רָצוֹן, etc. ;] \nwill, \n __(a) objectively = that which is willed: Mat.18:14, Luk.12:47, Jhn.5:30, 1Co.7:37, 1Th.5:18, 2Ti.2:26, Heb.10:10, Rev.4:11; θ. τ. θεοῦ, Act.22:14, Rom.2:18 12:2, Eph.1:9, Col.1:9 4:12, 1Pe.4:2; τ. κυρίου, Eph.5:17; pl., of precepts, Mrk.3:35, WH, mg., Act.13:22 (LXX); ἐστιν τὸ θ., with genitive of person(s), before ἵνα, Jhn.6:39-40, 1Co.16:12; with inf., 1Pe.2:15; with accusative and inf., 1Th.4:3 \n __(b) subjectively = τὸ θέλειν (cf. θέλησις): Luk.23:25, Jhn.1:13, 1Pe.3:17, 2Pe.1:21; ποιεῖν, Mat.7:21 12:50 21:31, Mrk.3:35 (pl., WH, mg., see supr.), Jhn.4:34 6:38 7:17 9:31, Eph.6:6, Heb.10:7, 9 10:36 13:21, 1Jn.2:17; γίνεσθαι, Mat.6:10 26:42, Luk.22:42, Act.21:14; ἡ εὐδοκία ( βουλὴ) τοῦ θ., Eph.1:5, 11; ἐν τῷ θ. τοῦ θεοῦ, Rom.1:10; διὰ θ. θεοῦ, Rom.15:32, 1Co.1:1, 2Co.1:1 8:5, Eph.1:1, Col.1:1, 2Ti.1:1; κατὰ τὸ θ. τ. θεοῦ, Gal.1:4, 1Pe.4:19, 1Jn.5:14; pl., Eph.2:3 (Cremer, 728).†\n (AS)","source_line":2456}],"occurrence_count":62,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"vontade","count":59},{"gloss":"da-vontade","count":1},{"gloss":"a-vontade","count":1},{"gloss":"pela-vontade","count":1}]},"G2792":{"id":"G2792","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2792","disambiguated_id":"G2792 =","unique_id":"G2792","headword":"κινάμωμον","transliteration":"kinamōmon","lexical_morphology":"G:N-N","gloss_en":"cinnamon","definition_en":"κιννάμωμον(Rec. κινάμ-), -υο, τό \n (from the Phænician, see LS, see word, and cf. Heb. קִנָּמוֹן) \ncinnamon: Rev.18:13.†\n (AS)","source_line":2984}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"canela","count":1}]},"G2929":{"id":"G2929","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2929","disambiguated_id":"G2929 =","unique_id":"G2929","headword":"κρυσταλλίζω","transliteration":"krustallizō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"be clear","definition_en":"κρυσταλλίζω\n (κρύσταλλος), \nto shine like crystal, be crystal-clear: Rev.21:11 (ἅπ, λεγ.).†\n (AS)","source_line":3124}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"cristal","count":1}]},"G2939":{"id":"G2939","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G2939","disambiguated_id":"G2939 =","unique_id":"G2939","headword":"κτίστης","transliteration":"ktistēs","lexical_morphology":"G:N-M","gloss_en":"creator","definition_en":"κτίστης, -oυ, ὁ\n (κτίζω), [in LXX: 2Ki.22:32 (Heb., al.), Jdth.9:12, Sir.24:8, 2 24:1-34; 4Ma.5:1-38 * ;] \n__1. (cl.) a founder. \n __2. a creator: of God, 1Pe.4:19.†\n (AS)","source_line":3134}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"Criador","count":1}]},"G3140":{"id":"G3140","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3140","disambiguated_id":"G3140 =","unique_id":"G3140","headword":"μαρτυρέω","transliteration":"martureō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to testify","definition_en":"μαρτυρέω, -ῶ\n (μάρτυς), [in LXX chiefly for עֵד (עֵד (Gen.31:47-48, al.), also for עוּד hi. (Gen.43:3, La 2:13), עָנָה (Num.35:30) ;] \n__(a) prop., to be a witness, bear witness, testify: absol. (find., al.), Jhn.15:27, Act.26:5; parenthetical (Bl., § 79, 7; MM, xvi), 2Co.8:3; with dative of person(s) (comm. and incomm.; El., § 37, 2), Act.22:5, Heb.10:15; id. before ὅτι, Mat.23:31, Rom.10:2, al.; accusative and inf., Act.10:43; with accusative of thing(s) (cl.), Jhn.3:11, Rev.22:16, 20; with accusative cogn., before περί, Jhn.5:32, 1Jn.5:10; with dative of thing(s), Jhn.5:33, Act.14:3, al.; before περί, with genitive (of person(s) and of thing(s)), Jhn.1:7-8, 15 2:25 18:23 21:24, al.; id. before ὅτι, Jhn.5:36 7:7; ὅτι, Jhn.1:34 4:44 al.; ὅτι recit., Jhn.4:39; κατά before ὅτι, 1Co.15:15; pass., Heb.7:8; ptcp., Rom.3:21; impers., Heb.7:17; \n __(b) in late Gk., to witness favourably, give a good report, approve (Bl., § 54, 3; MM, xvi; Deiss., BS, 265): with dative of person(s), Luk.4:22; before ἐπί with dative of thing(s), Heb.11:4; pass., Act.6:3; before ἐν, 1Ti.5:10, Heb.11:2; διά, with genitive of thing(s), Heb.11:39; with genitive of person(s), Act.10:22, al.; impers., III Jn 12 (cf. ἐπι, συν-επι-, κατα-, συν-μαρτυρέω) \n (AS)","source_line":3350}],"occurrence_count":76,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"testemunho","count":32},{"gloss":"testemunha","count":7},{"gloss":"testemunhou","count":6},{"gloss":"dou-testemunho","count":4},{"gloss":"testemunham","count":3},{"gloss":"damos-testemunho","count":3},{"gloss":"testemunhasse","count":2},{"gloss":"testemunhado","count":2},{"gloss":"testemunhamos","count":2},{"gloss":"testemunhas","count":2},{"gloss":"testemunharam","count":2},{"gloss":"testemunhava","count":1},{"gloss":"testemunhará","count":1},{"gloss":"testemunhareis","count":1},{"gloss":"buscai","count":1},{"gloss":"testemunhar","count":1},{"gloss":"de-quem-se-testifica","count":1},{"g